'''Raging Bahamut Cat''' (暴走のネコムート, ''Bōsō no Nekomūto'', '''Rampaging Cathamut''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. He was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]].

